# M25 VoxMorph (UE UVoxelMorphologyMeshesTool): Box 100 cm -> Dilate 20 cm (preview, Accept = new entity "Box VoxMorph", source hidden, Undo), then Contract 20 cm and Cancel. The operator runs in the background; the status frames cover its time.
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.55,0.6
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Дано run Modeling "VoxMorph inputs: Hide Inputs"
Дано --subject modeling set VoxMorph.VoxelCount 48
Дано --subject modeling set VoxMorph.Distance 20
Тогда 0_input the 100 cm Box selected, VoxOps palette
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxMorph"
Когда run Modeling "VoxMorph operation: Dilate"
Тогда 1a_dilate_status the panel status line reports the Dilate 20 cm result
Тогда-вид 1_dilate_preview VoxMorph bar (Accept/Cancel); the Box is visibly thicker with rounded edges; the original Box is not drawn
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 1_dilate a new entity "Box VoxMorph" is drawn (thick, rounded); the source Box is hidden
Тогда 1b_dilate_outliner the outliner shows "Box VoxMorph" selected, Box hidden
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 1_undo the VoxMorph entity is gone; the Box is visible at its original size
Дано run Entity Box
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxMorph"
Когда run Modeling "VoxMorph operation: Contract"
Тогда 2a_contract_status the panel status line reports the Contract 20 cm result
Тогда-вид 2_contract_preview the Box is visibly smaller with rounded edges
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда-вид 2_cancel the tool ended; the Box is back to its original size and visible
